  title: Anglo-Maratha Wars
  text: Three wars between 1775 and 1818 broke Maratha power. The Treaty of Bassein in 1802 made the Peshwa a subsidiary ally, and the third war ended with the Peshwa pensioned off and Maratha territories annexed.
